    {
      "text": "Fig 21, 'Example of outputs from this chapter'. The vision, goals, objectives and roadmap of Fig 10 (greyed), with three new rows: the DHSC target architecture for years 1–2 and years 3–4, an implementation roadmap (enhance the warehouse management system and integrate it with the national product catalogue, barcode scanning, an interoperability mediator, integration of HSCISs, data models and a data warehouse, aggregated analytics), and outcomes such as WMS rolled out to 40% of facilities and the mediator deployed with 30% of integrations done.",
